       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAIN-PLB-TOOL.
       AUTHOR. AUTONOMOUS-AI.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 2024-05-20.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PROGRAM-MODE. PIC X(10) VALUE 'BATCH-PROC'.
       01 WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT. PIC 9(8) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-ERROR-CODE. PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-MIGRATION-STATUS. PIC X(1) VALUE 'I'.
          * I=INIT, P=PROCESS, C=COMPLETE, E=ERROR
       01 WS-INPUT-FILE. PIC X(20) VALUE 'LEGACY-DB.DAT'.
       01 WS-OUTPUT-FILE. PIC X(20) VALUE 'MIGRATED.DAT'.
       01 WS-BATCH-QUEUE-HEAD. PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-BATCH-QUEUE-TAIL. PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-RECORD-COUNT. PIC 9(8) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-VALID-FLAG. PIC X VALUE 'Y'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE SECTION.
           DISPLAY 'PL/B MAINFRAME TRANSACTION TOOL'
           DISPLAY 'INITIATING BATCH ORCHESTRATION'
           PERFORM INITIATE-TRANSACTION-PROCESS
           PERFORM PROCESS-QUEUE-ITEMS
           PERFORM EXECUTE-DATA-MIGRATION
           PERFORM FINALIZE-TRANSACTIONS
           STOP RUN.

       INITIATE-TRANSACTION-PROCESS SECTION.
           MOVE 'P' TO WS-MIGRATION-STATUS
           DISPLAY 'TRANSACTION PROCESS INITIALIZED'
           DISPLAY 'LOADING BATCH QUEUE CONFIGURATION'
           PERFORM LOAD-QUEUE-CONFIG
           DISPLAY 'QUEUE LOADED SUCCESSFULLY'
           PERFORM RESET-MIGRATION-COUNTS.

       PROCESS-QUEUE-ITEMS SECTION.
           DISPLAY 'PROCESSING BATCH QUEUE ITEMS'
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-BATCH-QUEUE-HEAD > WS-BATCH-QUEUE-TAIL
               PERFORM DEQUEUE-NEXT-ITEM
               PERFORM VALIDATE-RECORD-STRUCTURE
               IF WS-VALID-FLAG = 'Y'
                   ADD 1 TO WS-RECORD-COUNT
                   ADD 1 TO WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT
                   PERFORM ROUTE-TO-PROCESSOR
               ELSE
                   ADD 1 TO WS-ERROR-CODE
                   DISPLAY 'RECORD VALIDATION FAILED'
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       LOAD-QUEUE-CONFIG SECTION.
           MOVE 100 TO WS-BATCH-QUEUE-HEAD
           MOVE 500 TO WS-BATCH-QUEUE-TAIL
           DISPLAY 'BATCH RANGE CONFIGURED'.

       DEQUEUE-NEXT-ITEM SECTION.
           ADD 1 TO WS-BATCH-QUEUE-HEAD
           DISPLAY 'DEQUEUED BATCH ITEM ' WS-BATCH-QUEUE-HEAD.

       VALIDATE-RECORD-STRUCTURE SECTION.
           * Simulate mainframe record validation
           IF WS-BATCH-QUEUE-HEAD > 999
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-VALID-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-VALID-FLAG
           END-IF.

       ROUTE-TO-PROCESSOR SECTION.
           DISPLAY 'ROUTING RECORD ' WS-RECORD-COUNT ' TO PROCESSOR'
           PERFORM EXECUTE-TRANSFORMATION-LOGIC.

       EXECUTE-DATA-MIGRATION SECTION.
           DISPLAY 'EXECUTING ENTERPRISE DATA MIGRATION'
           MOVE 'C' TO WS-MIGRATION-STATUS
           DISPLAY 'MIGRATION STATUS: COMPLETE'
           DISPLAY 'RECORDS PROCESSED: ' WS-RECORD-COUNT.

       FINALIZE-TRANSACTIONS SECTION.
           DISPLAY 'FINALIZING TRANSACTION LOG'
           DISPLAY 'TOTAL TRANSACTIONS: ' WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT
           DISPLAY 'ERRORS ENCOUNTERED: ' WS-ERROR-CODE
           DISPLAY 'TOOL EXECUTION COMPLETE'.

       RESET-MIGRATION-COUNTS SECTION.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RECORD-COUNT
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-ERROR-COUNT
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-VALID-FLAG.

       EXECUTE-TRANSFORMATION-LOGIC SECTION.
           * Core PL/B transformation logic placeholder
           * Handles field mapping, type conversion, and checksum validation
           * Optimized for IBM mainframe COBOL/PL-B compatibility
           DISPLAY 'TRANSFORMING RECORD DATA'.
